<title>USA: Brick Township Muni Authority, N.J. $56 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Brick Township Muni Authority, N.J. $56 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said Wednesday it tentatively priced $56 million of Brick Township Municipal Utilities Authority, N.J., revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.57 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The bonds are FGIC insured.  </p>
